## Problem 5: Longest Increasing Subsequence
### Description
Given an integer array `nums`, return the length of the longest strictly increasing subsequence.

### Solution
```python
def length_of_lis(nums):
    dp = [1] * len(nums)

    for i in range(1, len(nums)):
        for j in range(i):
            if nums[i] > nums[j]:
                dp[i] = max(dp[i], dp[j] + 1)

    return max(dp)
```

